WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.835 --> 00:00:02.919
[Driving synth beat]
- [Allen Robinson:] Whether it's playoff time,

00:00:02.919 --> 00:00:04.129
first game of the season,

00:00:04.129 --> 00:00:05.046
whatever it is, you know,

00:00:05.046 --> 00:00:06.673
you throw the ball,
Imma come down with it.

00:00:06.673 --> 00:00:08.299
- [Adam Lefkoe:] This is it, No. 10.

00:00:08.299 --> 00:00:11.344
Stunner. To the corner!

00:00:11.344 --> 00:00:12.178
Got it.

00:00:12.178 --> 00:00:13.179
- [Robinson:] Man, I'm sweating my butt off.

00:00:13.179 --> 00:00:15.015
Madden, you better up my rating.

00:00:15.015 --> 00:00:17.600
[Upbeat music]

00:00:27.861 --> 00:00:30.655
- Hey, everybody. Welcome to
another episode of "Underrated."

00:00:30.655 --> 00:00:32.282
I'm your host, Adam Lefkoe.

00:00:32.282 --> 00:00:34.784
If you've watched football
for the last half decade,

00:00:34.784 --> 00:00:37.287
it should not surprise
you that Allen Robinson

00:00:37.287 --> 00:00:39.539
has some top-flight Madden ratings.

00:00:39.539 --> 00:00:41.291
And if you've seen
commercials during that time,

00:00:41.291 --> 00:00:44.252
you probably also know that State Farm

00:00:44.252 --> 00:00:46.796
has surprisingly great rates.

00:00:46.796 --> 00:00:48.381
Back to Allen Robinson.

00:00:48.381 --> 00:00:50.341
We gotta get those ratings higher,

00:00:50.341 --> 00:00:52.802
and I got a Madden ratings
adjuster to talk to.

00:00:52.802 --> 00:00:55.388
Hey, Jake. Get Madden on the phone.

00:00:55.388 --> 00:00:58.516
- Calling Madden ratings adjuster.

00:00:58.516 --> 00:01:00.685
- [Lefkoe:] Mr. Oldenburg, I presume.

00:01:00.685 --> 00:01:02.062
Not wasting any time.

00:01:02.062 --> 00:01:05.356
Allen Robinson, do you agree
with me he's underrated?

00:01:05.356 --> 00:01:07.275
- I mean, it's possible he
could be underrated.

00:01:07.275 --> 00:01:11.071
He has played with some, not
always the best quarterbacks.

00:01:11.071 --> 00:01:12.655
- I'm glad you understand that.

00:01:12.655 --> 00:01:14.199
We don't even have to say their names.

00:01:14.199 --> 00:01:15.992
Let's call up Allen Robinson.

00:01:15.992 --> 00:01:20.121
Hey, Jake. Call best
friend, Allen Robinson.

00:01:20.121 --> 00:01:22.123
- Calling Allen Robinson.

00:01:23.875 --> 00:01:26.169
- [Lefkoe:] Allen Robinson. Only,

00:01:26.169 --> 00:01:29.839
I don't know, the most underrated
wide receiver in the NFL.

00:01:29.839 --> 00:01:31.091
How ya doin', pal?

00:01:31.091 --> 00:01:32.634
- I'm good, man. How you doing, Adam?

00:01:32.634 --> 00:01:35.136
- [Lefkoe:] Honestly, I'm a little annoyed.

00:01:35.136 --> 00:01:36.930
I was looking at your Madden ratings

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:38.431
and I saw where they had you.

00:01:38.431 --> 00:01:40.517
And as a very good friend,

00:01:40.517 --> 00:01:42.227
I cannot let that slide,

00:01:42.227 --> 00:01:43.561
but I am here to fix it.

00:01:43.561 --> 00:01:45.605
Allen, this is Clint Oldenburg.

00:01:45.605 --> 00:01:47.232
He is the Madden ratings adjuster.

00:01:47.232 --> 00:01:49.275
Clint, what would you like to say to Allen?

00:01:49.275 --> 00:01:51.402
- Ooh, Allen Robinson, one
of my favorite players.

00:01:51.402 --> 00:01:52.904
What do you got for me today?

00:01:52.904 --> 00:01:54.072
I like Allen a lot.

00:01:54.072 --> 00:01:55.824
- [Lefkoe:] All right, well, let's
get into the numbers here.

00:01:55.824 --> 00:01:57.951
First one. No one talks about it.

00:01:57.951 --> 00:02:01.162
Stamina. I mean, look at
this collection of 90s.

00:02:01.162 --> 00:02:04.999
We've got jumping, acceleration,
heck, even awareness,

00:02:04.999 --> 00:02:07.252
which means they think
that you're really smart.

00:02:07.252 --> 00:02:10.130
I just have no idea
why stamina isn't there

00:02:10.130 --> 00:02:11.506
with everything else.

00:02:11.506 --> 00:02:13.216
- I have no idea either.

00:02:13.216 --> 00:02:14.759
- [Lefkoe:] On Madden, I've seen it:

00:02:14.759 --> 00:02:17.929
Your character is bent
over huffin' and puffin'

00:02:17.929 --> 00:02:19.222
and ready to come out.

00:02:19.222 --> 00:02:22.642
Clint, second one: spectacular catches.

00:02:22.642 --> 00:02:25.353
I've seen this dude catch
balls off the helmet.

00:02:25.353 --> 00:02:26.688
What do I do to get that up?

00:02:26.688 --> 00:02:28.731
- Spec catch. Popular rating.

00:02:28.731 --> 00:02:30.859
Simply put, you gotta make amazing happen.

00:02:30.859 --> 00:02:34.362
We gotta see these, you know, wow
moments that occur in Madden.

00:02:34.362 --> 00:02:35.822
Gotta see those in real life.

00:02:35.822 --> 00:02:37.031
- Whether it's playoff time,

00:02:37.031 --> 00:02:38.158
first game of the season,

00:02:38.158 --> 00:02:39.576
college, whatever it is, you know,

00:02:39.576 --> 00:02:41.327
you throw the ball,
Imma come down with it.

00:02:41.327 --> 00:02:43.663
- Make amazing happen.

00:02:43.663 --> 00:02:45.456
Clint, I'll talk to you soon.

00:02:46.916 --> 00:02:49.127
[Upbeat music]

00:02:49.127 --> 00:02:51.296
- [Lefkoe:] So, Allen, I've seen you play.

00:02:51.296 --> 00:02:52.922
You wear down corners.

00:02:52.922 --> 00:02:55.008
You're not the one getting worn down.

00:02:55.008 --> 00:02:58.219
So what we're gonna do is
a bit of a hurry-up offense.

00:02:58.219 --> 00:02:59.679
We're gonna start on the 5,

00:02:59.679 --> 00:03:02.473
and if you can outlast
your Madden character,

00:03:02.473 --> 00:03:05.894
I think we can get the stamina
rating bumped up big time.

00:03:05.894 --> 00:03:06.769
- Sounds good.

00:03:06.769 --> 00:03:09.397
- [Lefkoe:] So we have assembled
this fine team right here.

00:03:09.397 --> 00:03:12.275
Together, you'll quickly
march down the field.

00:03:12.275 --> 00:03:13.693
No timeouts.

00:03:13.693 --> 00:03:14.694
No rest.

00:03:14.694 --> 00:03:16.738
We are upping my man's ratings today.

00:03:16.738 --> 00:03:18.615
- Most definitely. Let's get it done.

00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:24.204
- [Lefkoe:] Sweat is already
drippin'. I love it.

00:03:24.204 --> 00:03:25.622
All right, here we go, Allen.

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:29.167
Ooh. Up. Stop.

00:03:29.167 --> 00:03:30.126
Good catch.

00:03:30.126 --> 00:03:31.252
All right. Let's get going.

00:03:31.252 --> 00:03:32.420
No stopping.

00:03:32.420 --> 00:03:34.589
You got this, baby.

00:03:34.589 --> 00:03:36.507
Another one. Up. In.

00:03:36.507 --> 00:03:40.303
Oooh, made him get down and
get it on that one too.

00:03:40.303 --> 00:03:41.137
- [Offscreen:] Same play.

00:03:41.137 --> 00:03:42.555
- [Lefkoe:] Snap to the quarterback.

00:03:42.555 --> 00:03:44.182
Allen.

00:03:44.182 --> 00:03:45.391
Caught it. Turnin' upfield.

00:03:45.391 --> 00:03:49.562
The Bears are moving the chains.
Up. In.

00:03:50.772 --> 00:03:52.148
That one was high.

00:03:52.148 --> 00:03:53.983
Incomplete pass.

00:03:53.983 --> 00:03:56.027
Ooh, he's got a run block.

00:03:56.027 --> 00:03:58.071
By the way, it is really hot there.

00:03:58.071 --> 00:04:00.782
And I am in air conditioning, so...

00:04:01.699 --> 00:04:04.035
[Robinson breathing]

00:04:04.035 --> 00:04:05.912
- [Lefkoe:] Dime. We're good.

00:04:05.912 --> 00:04:08.122
[Intense music]

00:04:08.122 --> 00:04:10.250
- [Lefkoe:] This is where
his Madden character

00:04:10.250 --> 00:04:12.585
would start huffin' and puffin'.

00:04:12.585 --> 00:04:15.964
Now, slant, caught, movin' the chains.

00:04:15.964 --> 00:04:17.340
- [Offscreen:] Same play that you just did.

00:04:17.340 --> 00:04:18.174
Pace, pace.

00:04:19.509 --> 00:04:21.427
- [Lefkoe:] Throwin' it. Nice.

00:04:21.427 --> 00:04:22.929
Did he get in the end zone?

00:04:22.929 --> 00:04:25.014
No, just down there at the 1.

00:04:25.014 --> 00:04:29.394
This is it. No. 10.
Stunner. To the corner.

00:04:29.394 --> 00:04:30.979
Got it!

00:04:30.979 --> 00:04:33.940
How are you feelin', man?
That looked exhausting.

00:04:33.940 --> 00:04:35.316
- I feel great, man. I got 10 more in me.

00:04:35.316 --> 00:04:37.986
Let's go, Madden, boost that stamina up.

00:04:37.986 --> 00:04:38.861
- And, I mean, you ended it

00:04:38.861 --> 00:04:40.530
with the perfect touchdown, A-Rob.

00:04:40.530 --> 00:04:41.364
- Man, gotta end it with a

00:04:41.364 --> 00:04:43.283
little spectacular catch action, you know?

00:04:43.283 --> 00:04:45.702
- You must have read my mind.

00:04:45.702 --> 00:04:48.621
How would you feel about
making a highlight reel of you

00:04:48.621 --> 00:04:51.457
recreating five iconic NFL catches?

00:04:51.457 --> 00:04:52.959
- [Robinson:] Sounds good to me.

00:04:52.959 --> 00:04:55.086
[Upbeat music]

00:04:55.086 --> 00:04:56.587
- [Lefkoe:] So who are you thinking first?

00:04:56.587 --> 00:04:58.339
- Let's do the Randy Moss one first.

00:04:58.339 --> 00:04:59.799
- Now you're talkin', my man.

00:04:59.799 --> 00:05:03.886
The 2010 one-hander against
Revis. Let's see it.

00:05:03.886 --> 00:05:06.556
[Intense music]

00:05:14.939 --> 00:05:18.818
Is that Allen Moss?
[Ding]
Or is that Randy Robinson?

00:05:20.153 --> 00:05:21.154
All right. We got that one down.
- [Robinson laughing]

00:05:21.154 --> 00:05:23.990
- That one felt great. So
who're you thinking next?

00:05:23.990 --> 00:05:25.283
- Let's do Dwight.

00:05:25.283 --> 00:05:30.288
- OK, classic. "The Catch"
for the 1981 NFC championship.

00:05:30.413 --> 00:05:33.666
If you can give me all 42
inches of your vertical,

00:05:33.666 --> 00:05:34.792
I think it's over.

00:05:42.842 --> 00:05:43.760
[Ding]

00:05:43.760 --> 00:05:44.677
- What's your thoughts, Adam?

00:05:44.677 --> 00:05:46.763
- I think every time you go up for a ball,

00:05:46.763 --> 00:05:48.639
it's comin' down with Allen Robinson.

00:05:48.639 --> 00:05:50.725
- Most definitely. That's
what I like to hear.

00:05:50.725 --> 00:05:53.644
- So next would be…?

00:05:53.644 --> 00:05:55.146
- Let's go Santonio.

00:05:55.146 --> 00:05:57.231
- [Lefkoe:] Ooh, one of my favorites.

00:05:57.231 --> 00:06:00.360
Santonio Holmes in the
end zone in the Super Bowl.

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:02.028
Show me how it's done.

00:06:02.028 --> 00:06:04.614
[Intense music]

00:06:10.536 --> 00:06:12.789
- Ooh, bro, you went horizontal.

00:06:12.789 --> 00:06:14.040
- [Robinson:] I think that's the one, man.
[Ding]

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:16.542
- I think that was the one for sure.

00:06:16.542 --> 00:06:18.419
All right. Add it to the highlight.

00:06:18.419 --> 00:06:22.840
So the last one is Odell, and
this one's a little crazy.

00:06:23.716 --> 00:06:25.093
- [Robinson:] That was my rookie year.

00:06:25.093 --> 00:06:27.637
And I remember thinking,
like, that might—not might be,

00:06:27.637 --> 00:06:29.013
that probably to this day the

00:06:29.013 --> 00:06:30.765
craziest catch I've actually seen.

00:06:30.765 --> 00:06:34.811
- So I think if we give it
our best three attempts,

00:06:34.811 --> 00:06:37.105
I drop the most
impressive one on the reel,

00:06:37.105 --> 00:06:38.815
and I'll send that to Madden.

00:06:38.815 --> 00:06:39.941
- I can do that. I can do that.

00:06:41.317 --> 00:06:42.652
- I don't know about you guys,

00:06:42.652 --> 00:06:46.406
but I feel a surprisingly great
spectacular catch comin' on.

00:06:46.406 --> 00:06:49.075
[Intense music]

00:06:50.576 --> 00:06:51.411
[Buzz]

00:06:51.411 --> 00:06:52.245
- [Lefkoe:] Too high, man.

00:06:52.245 --> 00:06:53.079
You gotta keep it down a little bit,

00:06:53.079 --> 00:06:55.039
but I like the idea.

00:06:55.039 --> 00:06:57.708
[Intense music]

00:07:00.294 --> 00:07:01.212
- [Lefkoe:] Ah.

00:07:01.212 --> 00:07:03.005
[Buzz]

00:07:03.005 --> 00:07:06.008
Here we go. Everything on the line.

00:07:06.008 --> 00:07:08.553
Man, let her rip.

00:07:08.553 --> 00:07:10.680
Takes the snap.

00:07:10.680 --> 00:07:11.848
Fires, throws,

00:07:14.142 --> 00:07:16.185
and he hits it! Wow.

00:07:16.185 --> 00:07:17.019
[Ding]

00:07:17.019 --> 00:07:17.854
Add it to the highlight.

00:07:17.854 --> 00:07:20.982
EA Sports: in for a heck of a delivery.

00:07:20.982 --> 00:07:23.317
So, Allen, we showed the stamina.

00:07:23.317 --> 00:07:25.653
We showed the spectacular catches.

00:07:25.653 --> 00:07:29.532
Do you think we did enough for
the ratings adjuster today?

00:07:29.532 --> 00:07:30.741
- Man, I'm sweatin' my butt off.

00:07:30.741 --> 00:07:32.827
Madden, you better up my rating.

00:07:32.827 --> 00:07:34.245
- And if they don't move,

00:07:34.245 --> 00:07:36.414
I'm gonna get you on
the phone with the adjuster,

00:07:36.414 --> 00:07:39.167
and we're gonna take
care of this man to man.

00:07:39.167 --> 00:07:40.460
- Sounds good, man. I appreciate it.

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:43.171
- All right, we'll get it
done, man. You got my word.

00:07:44.380 --> 00:07:46.966
[Upbeat music]

00:07:48.342 --> 00:07:50.970
Clint, I have not seen an athlete

00:07:50.970 --> 00:07:53.639
get this sweaty for ratings before.

00:07:53.639 --> 00:07:55.516
The video looks great.

00:07:55.516 --> 00:07:57.602
What did you think of
it? It better be good.

00:07:57.602 --> 00:08:00.188
- There was some work
being done on this video.

00:08:00.188 --> 00:08:02.398
- I hope you reward him.
I'm bringing him on now.

00:08:02.398 --> 00:08:03.983
You're gonna have to
talk to him face to face.

00:08:03.983 --> 00:08:05.443
Let's call up Allen Robinson.

00:08:06.777 --> 00:08:09.363
Eyyy, there he is. Big 12.

00:08:09.363 --> 00:08:11.032
Clint, you looked at the tape.

00:08:11.032 --> 00:08:14.035
Spectacular catch and stamina.

00:08:14.035 --> 00:08:16.078
What did you think about
those two drills when you're

00:08:16.078 --> 00:08:17.163
watching on tape?

00:08:17.163 --> 00:08:18.873
- Obviously, great drills.

00:08:18.873 --> 00:08:22.001
I really liked how you made
him go through a 10-play drive.

00:08:22.001 --> 00:08:23.085
That was phenomenal.

00:08:23.085 --> 00:08:24.879
- OK, explain that.

00:08:24.879 --> 00:08:28.758
- [Oldenburg:] So going up two
points in stamina from 89 to 91

00:08:28.758 --> 00:08:31.385
from the 24th-rated wide
receiver in stamina,

00:08:31.385 --> 00:08:34.347
now at 15th place for wide receivers.

00:08:34.347 --> 00:08:36.224
And he's passed some, you know, amazing players

00:08:36.224 --> 00:08:38.434
like A.J. Green and Adam
Thielen in that area.

00:08:38.434 --> 00:08:40.895
- You went from a B-plus to an A-minus.

00:08:41.771 --> 00:08:42.939
- Gotta keep just movin' 'em on up.

00:08:42.939 --> 00:08:44.982
- [Oldenburg:] All right, spec catch, Allen,

00:08:44.982 --> 00:08:46.567
you're gonna get a one-point upgrade.
[Ding]

00:08:46.567 --> 00:08:48.653
You're going from 94 to 95.

00:08:48.653 --> 00:08:51.906
So you're going from the
10th-best wide receiver to

00:08:51.906 --> 00:08:54.367
you're now tied for the
eighth-best wide receiver

00:08:54.367 --> 00:08:55.493
in spec catch.

00:08:55.493 --> 00:08:57.662
- 95 is a hard A. Clint.

00:08:57.662 --> 00:08:59.372
- Top eight, top eight.

00:08:59.372 --> 00:09:00.706
- OK.

00:09:00.706 --> 00:09:01.999
- That's good news. That's good news.

00:09:01.999 --> 00:09:02.833
That's what we worked for, man.

00:09:02.833 --> 00:09:03.793
That's why we went out on the field.

00:09:03.793 --> 00:09:05.711
- And now the big question:

00:09:05.711 --> 00:09:08.714
Is Allen Robinson underrated?

00:09:08.714 --> 00:09:12.843
- In the NFL world, Allen
Robinson is absolutely the most

00:09:12.843 --> 00:09:15.096
underrated player in the NFL.

00:09:15.096 --> 00:09:16.973
From a Madden standpoint,

00:09:16.973 --> 00:09:19.809
Allen Robinson is a little bit underrated.

00:09:19.809 --> 00:09:21.435
- Allen, overall,

00:09:21.435 --> 00:09:25.731
how does it feel to know
that you were underrated?

00:09:25.731 --> 00:09:26.566
- You know, I think it's fun. You know,

00:09:26.566 --> 00:09:29.610
I don't ever think I've
started the year off at a 90,

00:09:29.610 --> 00:09:32.196
so I really take pride in, you know,

00:09:32.196 --> 00:09:34.073
seeing how those drills paid off.

00:09:34.073 --> 00:09:36.284
- I love it when a good
plan comes together

00:09:36.284 --> 00:09:39.078
and it ends up being surprisingly great.

00:09:39.078 --> 00:09:42.999
And this has been a surprisingly
great episode of "Underrated"

00:09:42.999 --> 00:09:45.209
brought to you by the
surprisingly great rates

00:09:45.209 --> 00:09:46.836
of State Farm.

00:09:46.836 --> 00:09:49.171
Allen, you're the man, dude.

00:09:49.171 --> 00:09:52.008
[Energetic music]

